"已保存预处理图到相册。查看时请保持相同显示大小和观看距离。" = "Saved to Photos. View it at the same display size and viewing distance.";
"保存到相册失败：%@" = "Could not save to Photos: %@";
"请重试或保存到文件。" = "Try again or save to Files.";
"左侧测试区域" = "Left test area";
"右侧测试区域" = "Right test area";
"条纹显示示例" = "Stripe display sample";
"左侧为放大的示意条纹，右侧为灰色。此页仅检查屏幕显示，不需要测距，不记录作答，也不计算度数。" = "The left side shows enlarged sample stripes and the right side is plain grey. This page only checks the display: no distance, no recorded answers and no calculation.";
"条纹显示示例区域" = "Stripe sample areas";
"正式测试会使用更细的条纹，并在距离已确认、到达目标且读数稳定后显示。示例清晰不代表测量准确。" = "The real test uses finer stripes, shown only after the distance is confirmed, on target and stable. A clear sample does not mean an accurate measurement.";
"返回测距与测试" = "Back to distance and test";
"尚无有效距离" = "No valid distance yet";
"人工距离尚未确认。请填写实测距离，再点击“确认已实测，并保持不动”。" = "Manual distance not confirmed. Enter the measured distance, then press “Confirm measured and hold still”.";
"请先开始练习与测量。" = "Start practice and test first.";
"当前距离 %1$.1f 厘米，尚未到达目标。请到 %2$.1f–%3$.1f 厘米范围内；人工模式需重新实测并确认。" = "Current distance %1$.1f cm is not on target. Move to %2$.1f–%3$.1f cm; in manual mode, measure and confirm again.";
"当前距离下条纹像素不足。请检查蓝线实测长度并重新校准屏幕，不能通过猜填距离继续。" = "Not enough pixels for the stripes at this distance. Check the measured blue line and recalibrate; do not continue by guessing a distance.";
"当前测试区域放不下完整图案。请保持设备姿态，停止本轮并重新校准显示区域。" = "The test area cannot fit the whole pattern. Keep the device orientation, stop this round and recalibrate the display.";
"距离已到位，正在等待读数稳定；请保持不动。" = "On target; waiting for a stable reading. Hold still.";
"哪一侧有条纹？不确定时请猜测。" = "Which side has stripes? Guess if unsure.";
"图案已显示，请观察片刻，按钮即将启用。" = "Pattern shown. Look for a moment; the buttons will be enabled shortly.";
"请用尺子测量蓝色线段的实际长度并输入厘米数。" = "Measure the real length of the blue line with a ruler and enter it in centimetres.";
"屏幕已校准。最近测试距离为%ld厘米，由屏幕实际分辨能力决定。" = "Screen calibrated. The nearest test distance is %ld cm, set by the screen’s real resolving power.";
"屏幕分辨能力不足以完成当前测试。" = "The screen’s resolving power is not sufficient for this test.";
"显示区域或屏幕发生变化，本轮已停止，请重新校准后测试。" = "The display area or screen changed; this round stopped. Recalibrate before testing.";
"显示区域或屏幕发生变化，请重新测量蓝线，并重新确认距离或摄像头校准。" = "The display area or screen changed. Measure the blue line again and reconfirm the distance or camera calibration.";
"界面显示方向已改变，本轮已停止。屏幕尺寸校准保留，请重新确认观看距离后再开始。" = "Interface orientation changed; this round stopped. Screen calibration is kept; reconfirm the viewing distance before starting again.";
"界面显示方向已改变，屏幕尺寸校准保留；请重新确认观看距离。" = "Interface orientation changed; screen calibration is kept. Reconfirm the viewing distance.";
"请输入实际测量的距离和误差。" = "Enter the actually measured distance and error.";
"人工距离已确认，不再按30秒重置。保持位置不动；每次移动、目标距离变化或中断后，需重新实测并确认。" = "Manual distance confirmed; it no longer resets after 30 seconds. Stay still; measure and confirm again after any move, target change or interruption.";
"请正视屏幕并保持稳定，再记录校准点。" = "Face the screen and hold still before recording a calibration point.";
"第一个位置已记录。移动到第二个实测位置后点击核验。" = "First position recorded. Move to the second measured position and press Verify.";
"请保持相同姿态、相同摄像头，在两个实测距离完成校准。" = "Keep the same pose and camera and calibrate at both measured distances.";
"两点校准通过，仅可在这两个距离之间估距。摄像头重启后需要重新校准。" = "Two-point calibration passed; distances can be estimated only between these two points. Recalibrate after restarting the camera.";
"摄像头尚无可靠距离，请完成校准或切换人工测距" = "No reliable camera distance yet; complete calibration or switch to manual distance";
"请完成屏幕校准、匿名编号和适用条件确认。" = "Complete screen calibration, the anonymous ID and the eligibility confirmations.";
"视觉测试期间保持屏幕显示" = "Keep the display on during the vision test";
"先完成8次练习：找出有条纹的一侧。若看不清，请猜测，勿眯眼。" = "Complete 8 practice trials first: find the side with stripes. If unsure, guess; do not squint.";
"练习未达到7/8正确，暂不能进行远点测量。请检查屏幕尺寸或重新练习。" = "Practice was below 7/8 correct, so far-point testing cannot start. Check the screen size or practise again.";
"开始正式测试。移动到目标距离，位置稳定后选择有条纹的一侧。" = "Test starting. Move to the target distance and, once steady, choose the side with stripes.";
"当前测试超出范围。" = "This test is out of range.";
"当前方向完成。下一方向需要重新寻找边界，可随时停止并保留记录。" = "Direction complete. The next direction needs a new boundary search; you can stop at any time and keep the record.";
"目标距离已改变。请到新位置重新实测，再点击“确认已实测，并保持不动”。" = "The target distance changed. Measure again at the new position, then press “Confirm measured and hold still”.";
"测试已完成。结果是未经临床验证的研究估计。" = "Test complete. The result is a clinically unvalidated research estimate.";
"记录保存失败：%@。请立即导出。" = "Could not save records: %@. Export now.";
"临时记录保存失败，请导出当前记录。" = "Could not save the draft record; export the current record.";
"历史记录无法读取，原文件已保留；新记录另存为 recovered-sessions.json，请导出备份。" = "History could not be read; the original file was kept. New records go to recovered-sessions.json. Please export a backup.";
"上次测试中断，仅恢复原始记录，未继续输出度数。" = "The previous test was interrupted; only raw data were recovered and no values were reported.";
"可使用键盘、协助者，或开启本机语音作答。" = "Answer with the keyboard, a helper, or on-device voice.";
"当前设备没有可用于当前界面语言的本机语音识别。请用键盘或请协助者点击；不会切换云端识别。" = "On-device speech recognition is not available for the current interface language. Use the keyboard or a helper; cloud recognition is never used.";
"语音识别未授权，请用按钮或键盘。" = "Speech recognition not authorized. Use the buttons or keyboard.";
"麦克风未授权，请用按钮或键盘。" = "Microphone not authorized. Use the buttons or keyboard.";
"语音启动失败，请用按钮、键盘或协助者。" = "Voice failed to start. Use the buttons, keyboard or a helper.";
"本机语音正在听：请说“左边”或“右边”；说“停止”结束。" = "Listening on device: say “left” or “right”; say “stop” to finish.";
"本机语音已开启，等待图案就绪。请在按钮可用后说“左边”或“右边”；随时可说“停止”。" = "On-device voice is on, waiting for the pattern. Say “left” or “right” once the buttons are enabled; say “stop” at any time.";
"语音正在恢复，请稍候再说；也可用按钮作答。" = "Voice is recovering; wait a moment before speaking, or use the buttons.";
"本机语音暂时不可用，请重新开启或用按钮作答。" = "On-device voice is temporarily unavailable. Turn it on again or use the buttons.";
"语音已关闭，可使用按钮、键盘或协助者作答。" = "Voice is off. Answer with the buttons, keyboard or a helper.";
